OL,3,GNEWSADerailed train will not hurt
OL,4,Atourism, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisruption caused by a derailed train
OL,7,Fin Essex was unlikely to have an impact
OL,8,Fon tourism in Southend-on-Sea, the
OL,9,Fcouncil said.
OL,11,FThe Greater Anglia service from
OL,12,FSouthend Victoria to London Liverpool
OL,13,FStreet came off the tracks in Wickford
OL,14,Fon Friday, leading to the line between
OL,15,FBillericay and Hockley being shut.
OL,17,FGreater Anglia said the damage to more
OL,18,Fthan a mile and a half of track was
OL,19,Fexpected to take another week to
OL,20,Frepair, with passengers being directed
OL,21,Fto use alternative rail replacement
OL,22,Fbuses and shuttle rail services.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
