OL,3,GNEWSADerailed train will not hurt
OL,4,Atourism, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Dent, the cabinet member for
OL,7,Fbusiness, culture, music and tourism on
OL,8,FSouthend-on-Sea City Council, said the
OL,9,Farea was "lucky" to be served by a
OL,10,Fsecond railway line.
